+decoder and duplicate-event state; clocks, normality scoring, window/update
+sizes and lookahead are unchanged. Incompatible encoders or stream timings are
+rejected before capture. Standalone launchers and offline inference still work
+independently. No training files or model weights are modified by this runtime.
 
